	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c04r0401_badman_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ぼくたちは　スポーツだいすき　でね
しあい　だけでなく▽
れんしゅうも　けんがく　しているのさ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-29T09:30:07" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ぼくたちは　スポーツ大好きでね
試合だけでなく▽
練習も　見学しているのさ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-29T09:30:28" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・下記OBJと隣接
・試合中は非表示</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:11" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>BADMAN</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:11" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:11" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c04r0401_woman2_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ひとと　ポケモンとが　おりなす
あたらしい　かたちの▽
バスケや　テニス……▽
これって　スポーツの　しんかけいかも</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-29T09:30:16" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>人と　ポケモンとが　織り成す
新しい　形の▽
バスケや　テニス……▽
これって　スポーツの　進化系かも</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-29T09:30:25" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・上記OBJと隣接
・試合中は非表示</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:11" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>WOMAN2</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:11" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:11" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c04r0401_sunglasses_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>れんしゅうちゅうの　せんしゅに
はなしかけると　ポケモンしょうぶを▽
いどまれることも　あるぞ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:11" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>練習中の　選手に
話しかけると　ポケモン勝負を▽
挑まれることも　あるぞ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:11" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・分岐なし</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:11" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SUNGLASSES</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:11" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:11" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c04r0401_tennisw_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>いちりゅうの　テニスプレイヤーが
ポケモンと　いっしょに▽
コートで　まってるわよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:11" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>一流の　テニスプレイヤーが
ポケモンと　一緒に▽
コートの　上で　待ってるわよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:11" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
